{"id":"2754b0b2a80093e8","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-dolbeault.md","title":"Dolbeault Cohomology","display":"df-dolbeault — Dolbeault Cohomology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dolbeault","aliases":["58-df-dolbeault"],"display":"df-dolbeault — Dolbeault Cohomology","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dolbeault"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dolbeault</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dolbeault — Dolbeault Cohomology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55889258754cb9d9\" href=\"?note=55889258754cb9d9\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md\">../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,X,\\mathcal T,\\Omega,\\bar\\partial\\in V\\land n,p,q\\in\\omega\">\\(H,X,\\mathcal T,\\Omega,\\bar\\partial\\in V\\land n,p,q\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (complex-manifold predicate with topology and dimension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DolbeaultCohomologyData}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{DolbeaultCohomologyData}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (cohomology graph relative to explicit bigraded data, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dolbeault} \\vdash \\mathrm{DolbeaultCohomologyData}_S(H,X,\\mathcal T,n,p,q,\\Omega,\\bar\\partial)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\mathcal T,n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar\\partial,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar\\partial))\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\bar\\partial_{a,b}:\\Omega^{a,b}\\to\\Omega^{a,b+1}\\land\\bar\\partial_{a,b+1}\\circ\\bar\\partial_{a,b}=0_{\\Omega^{a,b},\\Omega^{a,b+2}}\\right)\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl(q=0\\land H=\\ker(\\bar\\partial_{p,0})\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(q&gt;0\\land H=\\ker(\\bar\\partial_{p,q})/\\operatorname{im}(\\bar\\partial_{p,q-1})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dolbeault} \\vdash \\mathrm{DolbeaultCohomologyData}_S(H,X,\\mathcal T,n,p,q,\\Omega,\\bar\\partial)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\mathcal T,n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar\\partial,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar\\partial))\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\bar\\partial_{a,b}:\\Omega^{a,b}\\to\\Omega^{a,b+1}\\land\\bar\\partial_{a,b+1}\\circ\\bar\\partial_{a,b}=0_{\\Omega^{a,b},\\Omega^{a,b+2}}\\right)\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl(q=0\\land H=\\ker(\\bar\\partial_{p,0})\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(q&gt;0\\land H=\\ker(\\bar\\partial_{p,q})/\\operatorname{im}(\\bar\\partial_{p,q-1})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The current knowledge base has no compatible atom constructing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,q)\">\\((p,q)\\)</span>-forms from a complex atlas.  This definition therefore makes the bigraded complex explicit data rather than misusing the real differential-form atom.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=0\">\\(q=0\\)</span> case is separated so that no nonexistent degree-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-1)\">\\((-1)\\)</span> differential is invoked.</li>\n<li>Dolbeault cohomology computes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{\\partial}\">\\(\\bar{\\partial}\\)</span>-cohomology.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^{p,q}_{\\bar{\\partial}} \\cong H^q(X, \\Omega^p)\">\\(H^{p,q}_{\\bar{\\partial}} \\cong H^q(X, \\Omega^p)\\)</span> (Dolbeault theorem).</li>\n<li>Hodge theory: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^k(X, \\mathbb{C}) = \\bigoplus_{p+q=k} H^{p,q}\">\\(H^k(X, \\mathbb{C}) = \\bigoplus_{p+q=k} H^{p,q}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{\\partial}\">\\(\\bar{\\partial}\\)</span>-Poincaré lemma gives local triviality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{\\partial}\">\\(\\bar{\\partial}\\)</span>-cohomology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md","status":"resolved","id":"55889258754cb9d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (complex-manifold predicate with topology and dimension, see [[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,X,\\mathcal T,\\Omega,\\bar\\partial\\in V\\land n,p,q\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DolbeaultCohomologyData}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dolbeault} \\vdash \\mathrm{DolbeaultCohomologyData}_S(H,X,\\mathcal T,n,p,q,\\Omega,\\bar\\partial)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\mathcal T,n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar\\partial,\\omega\\times\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar\\partial))\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\bar\\partial_{a,b}:\\Omega^{a,b}\\to\\Omega^{a,b+1}\\land\\bar\\partial_{a,b+1}\\circ\\bar\\partial_{a,b}=0_{\\Omega^{a,b},\\Omega^{a,b+2}}\\right)\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl(q=0\\land H=\\ker(\\bar\\partial_{p,0})\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(q>0\\land H=\\ker(\\bar\\partial_{p,q})/\\operatorname{im}(\\bar\\partial_{p,q-1})\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"(p,q)","display":false},{"tex":"q=0","display":false},{"tex":"(-1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\partial}","display":false},{"tex":"H^{p,q}_{\\bar{\\partial}} \\cong H^q(X, \\Omega^p)","display":false},{"tex":"H^k(X, \\mathbb{C}) = \\bigoplus_{p+q=k} H^{p,q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\partial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\partial}","display":false}],"bytes":2107,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-450","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-dolbeault.md|58-df-dolbeault]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["0ab38aca0c5161bb","36d7463d215be751","55889258754cb9d9"]}